# ==============================================================================
# IBVAP — Frontend Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================

# API Base URL:
# - If deploying with Docker / Nginx reverse proxy (Option 1): Leave empty or set to /api/v1
# - If deploying frontend on Vercel/Netlify with backend on Render (Option 2):
#   Set to your public backend URL e.g.:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://ibvap-backend.onrender.com/api/v1
VITE_API_URL=/api/v1
